// If a subsequent command changes TPM state saved by [TPM2_Shutdown], then the
// effect of [TPM2_Shutdown] is nullified. The TPM MAY nullify [TPM2_Shutdown]
// for any subsequent command rather than check whether the command changed
// state saved by [TPM2_Shutdown]. If [TPM2_Shutdown] is nullified. and if no
// TPM2_Shutdown() occurs before the next TPM2_Startup(), then the next
// TPM2_Startup() shall be TPM2_Startup(TPM_SU_CLEAR).
TpmTestVector(
  name: "[TPM2_Shutdown] nullified shutdown requires startup clear",
  spec_versions: [
    184,
  ],
  test_sequence: [
  ]
)
